  <text id="title" x="40" y="68" width="1120" height="52" font="heading" color="inkgreen">全局界面契约：所有页面共享一套可感知规则</text>
  <text id="lead" x="40" y="128" width="1120" height="34" font="body" size="18" color="secondary">只增加最后加载的视觉与可访问性层；不删除书籍、学习数据、阅读器、AI 或既有业务函数。</text>
  <shape id="g1" type="rect" x="55" y="205" width="270" height="130" fill="#F4F2EA" stroke="linegold" stroke-width="1" corner-radius="4"/>
  <icon id="i1" name="focus" x="78" y="228" width="32" height="32" color="inkgreen"/>
  <text id="t1" x="125" y="224" width="175" height="28" font="body" size="19" color="inkgreen"><strong>可见焦点</strong></text>
  <text id="b1" x="78" y="270" width="210" height="45" font="caption" size="15" color="secondary">键盘焦点统一金色描边，所有入口可判断当前位置。</text>
  <shape id="g2" type="rect" x="355" y="205" width="270" height="130" fill="#F4F2EA" stroke="linegold" stroke-width="1" corner-radius="4"/>
  <icon id="i2" name="hand" x="378" y="228" width="32" height="32" color="inkgreen"/>
  <text id="t2" x="425" y="224" width="175" height="28" font="body" size="19" color="inkgreen"><strong>触控反馈</strong></text>
  <text id="b2" x="378" y="270" width="210" height="45" font="caption" size="15" color="secondary">普通入口至少 42px；按压缩放 .985，不使用夸张悬浮放大。</text>
  <shape id="g3" type="rect" x="655" y="205" width="270" height="130" fill="#F4F2EA" stroke="linegold" stroke-width="1" corner-radius="4"/>
  <icon id="i3" name="languages" x="678" y="228" width="32" height="32" color="inkgreen"/>
  <text id="t3" x="725" y="224" width="175" height="28" font="body" size="19" color="inkgreen"><strong>双向文字</strong></text>
  <text id="b3" x="678" y="270" width="210" height="45" font="caption" size="15" color="secondary">Arabic / 中文采用 plaintext 隔离，避免控件整体倒序。</text>
  <shape id="g4" type="rect" x="955" y="205" width="270" height="130" fill="#F4F2EA" stroke="linegold" stroke-width="1" corner-radius="4"/>
  <icon id="i4" name="smartphone" x="978" y="228" width="32" height="32" color="inkgreen"/>
  <text id="t4" x="1025" y="224" width="175" height="28" font="body" size="19" color="inkgreen"><strong>安全区</strong></text>
  <text id="b4" x="978" y="270" width="210" height="45" font="caption" size="15" color="secondary">手机普通页面为底部导航保留空间，阅读器和全屏工作区例外。</text>
  <shape id="g5" type="rect" x="205" y="380" width="270" height="130" fill="#F4F2EA" stroke="linegold" stroke-width="1" corner-radius="4"/>
  <icon id="i5" name="square" x="228" y="403" width="32" height="32" color="inkgreen"/>
  <text id="t5" x="275" y="399" width="175" height="28" font="body" size="19" color="inkgreen"><strong>克制容器</strong></text>
  <text id="b5" x="228" y="445" width="210" height="45" font="caption" size="15" color="secondary">共享产品表面统一 4px 圆角，以排版和细线代替厚重卡片。</text>
  <shape id="g6" type="rect" x="505" y="380" width="270" height="130" fill="#F4F2EA" stroke="linegold" stroke-width="1" corner-radius="4"/>
  <icon id="i6" name="accessibility" x="528" y="403" width="32" height="32" color="inkgreen"/>
  <text id="t6" x="575" y="399" width="175" height="28" font="body" size="19" color="inkgreen"><strong>减弱动效</strong></text>
  <text id="b6" x="528" y="445" width="210" height="45" font="caption" size="15" color="secondary">尊重 prefers-reduced-motion，保留功能但移除非必要动画。</text>
  <shape id="g7" type="rect" x="805" y="380" width="270" height="130" fill="#F4F2EA" stroke="linegold" stroke-width="1" corner-radius="4"/>
  <icon id="i7" name="book-open" x="828" y="403" width="32" height="32" color="inkgreen"/>
  <text id="t7" x="875" y="399" width="175" height="28" font="body" size="19" color="inkgreen"><strong>阅读留白</strong></text>
  <text id="b7" x="828" y="445" width="210" height="45" font="caption" size="15" color="secondary">Apple Books 式正文纸面保持独立，不被全局底部留白干扰。</text>
